+Among the 2,286 stable-ID rows, Z-score pentagon area correlates $r=0.805$ with WAR (player-clustered 95\% CI [0.778, 0.828]; Fig.~\ref{fig:alignment}). This is an internal-consistency check because representation inputs overlap directly or indirectly with value metrics, not independent construct validation.
 
